{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-11-06T10:03:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118645516087300242"],"id":"2118645516087300242","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":45,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这是我过去3个月用的草稿纸 https://t.co/Yrh3emSl8o","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2118645516087300242"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-11-06T05:11:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118571876914213284"],"id":"2118571876914213284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4621,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":93,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我的自控力好差呀，在家自学没人管着全靠自己有点困难，我每天都会制定第二天的学习计划，但是第二天根本无法按时起床，而且有可能一件事情比较拖延做好久，导致下一个计划无法实施，再这样下去，高考只剩213天了，我可能连大专都考不上...","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2118571876914213284"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-11-05T12:01:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118312634567278881"],"id":"2118312634567278881","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5228,"like_count":72,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近反正不用送外卖了，索性买了好多平时想穿又不敢穿的衣服，等快递回来我一件一件上身测评，到时候会返图哦～ https://t.co/AoEkYZviK1","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2118312634567278881"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-11-05T02:09:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118163708220522786"],"id":"2118163708220522786","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":11294,"like_count":129,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":147,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我报名了明年高考，现在也辞掉了送外卖的工作，每天专门在家自学，但我自控力比较差，不能按时起床，这就导致原本安排的今日学习任务直接作废，一整天的计划都乱了，我到底该怎么办呀？还有200多天就高考了...","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2118163708220522786"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:32:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118003550311927993"],"id":"2118003550311927993","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4717,"like_count":37,"quote_count"